{"time": 1775653911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1858534720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=24F7F7C8F075BF01B7095AF6AEB7C599.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQTY7M2UQFJt6PfhAe741Jo5DdHYxjCeiD_Cijg4sCkqt6TAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhB90r4kp4J6eccU6Py83PPeegJ78IIBAm5q&amp;rkey=CAQSML_ucpGzVxYHSKohrxawCl81pkgHD3sayjsDuOOdScNQAZ9QqxMqncHMOQ8qvIkwmA,file_size=15682]"}
{"time": 1775653917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1374672422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "“怕老板被我的刺青吓到了，活跃一下气氛"}
{"time": 1775653929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759671484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那不是完蛋了）"}
{"time": 1775653943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1851102980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“小女子要带着几个脑子有问题的人，实在有些辛苦。”扶额摇头，“不错，我们确实是来调查的、”"}
{"time": 1775653947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "290591380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "汉斯叹了口气，颓然地靠在柜台上。"}
{"time": 1775653970, "type": "recv", "message_id": "781910657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "”汉斯先生，是愚人众的问题吗"}
{"time": 1775653973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1770028374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“大约两个月前，一个自称‘枫丹学者’的男人找到我。他说他在进行一项关于元素平衡的研究，需要大量晶核、元素碎片，还有……呃，一些‘特殊材料’。”\n他舔了舔干裂的嘴唇。\n“他出价很高，非常高。三倍于市场价。我……我承认我动心了。他让我在普通的元素稳定剂里加入一种他提供的催化剂粉末，说这样可以‘追踪元素流动’。他说这是无害的！只是实验需要！”"}
{"time": 1775653988, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725024112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "汉斯的声音越来越低。\n“我问他为什么要通过我卖，而不是直接招募志愿者。他说……‘人们不会接受自己被当成实验对象的’。我当时就该警觉的……可我……”"}
{"time": 1775653995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954714904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "他痛苦地捂住脸。"}
{"time": 1775654007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107834260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“他大约四十来岁，黑发，有须弥口音——虽然他说自己是枫丹人，但我听得出来。他的眼睛……”"}
{"time": 1775654029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1027273162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "汉斯打了个寒颤，“他的眼睛里有一种我从未见过的东西。不是邪恶，更像是……疯狂？或者说，太过于炽热的理想？”"}
{"time": 1775654050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "717497662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“他总是穿着一件深蓝色的长袍，领口别着一枚奇特的胸针——看上去像一朵倒置的八瓣花。我从未见过那种图案。”"}
{"time": 1775654080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "651729441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "”汉斯先生，我们也许可以帮你解决问题"}
{"time": 1775654095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897718555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“然后呢？”"}
{"time": 1775654100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1090648811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "“要出手的话，没有官方立场的我们比骑士团更方便”"}
{"time": 1775654114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1150784913", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好吧，好吧。”双手一摊，“既然摊牌了，那……最近是不是有人在盯着你？”"}
