{"time": 1775827113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "680936220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "阶梯的尽头是一片被人工开凿出的开阔空间。这里的墙壁上残留着矿工宿舍的痕迹——一个个凿入岩壁的凹室，曾经是矿工们休息的地方。但现在，这些凹室被装上了粗铁栅栏，变成了一间间牢房。\n空气中弥漫着汗水、铁锈和消毒药水混合的刺鼻气味。你们听到了一些微弱的声音：有人在低声呻吟，有人在喃喃自语。"}
{"time": 1775827137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2121912165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "牢房区布局：\n这一层共有六个牢房，呈环形分布。中央是一个堆满医疗器械和记录文档的长桌。"}
{"time": 1775827160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "70674507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "376030837"}, "sender": {"id": "376030837", "name": "熊木"}, "message": "（牢内！）"}
{"time": 1775827161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928525040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看起来像是什么集中营”"}
{"time": 1775827175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1763020578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={BCDE8D7B-CC16-2FAE-A15C-B4053BA4D969}.png,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-BCDE8D7BCC162FAEA15CB4053BA4D969/0,file_size=19795]"}
{"time": 1775827202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125226932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "“大家还是一起逐个探索吧，不要贸然分兵”"}
{"time": 1775827239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "781494249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "目前有三间牢房关押着人"}
{"time": 1775827260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "115632800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "一个瘦削的中年男子，蜷缩在角落，左臂缠着染血的绷带。他眼神空洞，嘴里反复念叨着一些听不懂的数字。"}
{"time": 1775827266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "769197744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "一个年轻女性冒险家，看起来二十出头，神情警惕。"}
{"time": 1775827271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1347521330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "一个穿着破烂西风骑士团制服的中年男人"}
{"time": 1775827275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "801975038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "（114514，1919810"}
{"time": 1775827275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1039290990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "（APP多少"}
{"time": 1775827317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "859423465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "穿过牢房区，矿道的氛围再次变化。周围的岩壁不再是天然岩石与人工木架的结合，而是变成了规整的、精心切割过的深色石砖。这些石砖上覆盖着你们从未见过的奇特纹路——那是一种古老的、充满几何美感的浮雕，描绘着蜿蜒的线条和交错的圆环。\n这不是蒙德的建筑风格，甚至不属于任何一个你们所知的当代文明。这里的空气更加沉重，似乎时间本身在这里都变得缓慢。\n走廊的尽头，一扇巨大的石门挡住了去路。石门高达十五尺，表面没有一丝缝隙，仿佛是用一整块黑曜石雕琢而成。门上镌刻着密密麻麻的古老符文"}
{"time": 1775827347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073368083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“暂时没发现敌人”"}
{"time": 1775827355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "119628581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "“唯有前进”"}
{"time": 1775827449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "151574702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "一个年轻女性冒险家，看起来二十出头，神情警惕"}
{"time": 1775827456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "574645878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“我叫莉亚娜”"}
{"time": 1775827556, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1124141847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“我是被稻妻机器人抓进来的”"}
{"time": 1775827563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748889481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“小女子初来此地居然还能遇见这等奇遇。”耸肩，“你们不会是被门口那几个高大的构装体抓进来的吧”"}
{"time": 1775827567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886223000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“我去不早说”"}
{"time": 1775827599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1874044414", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "伊利亚每隔几天会带人去“下面的实验室”，那些人回来时都变得虚弱不堪。她曾听到守卫提到“炼成阵”和“满月之夜”。"}
{"time": 1775827619, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1485392856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“伊利亚是哪位”"}
{"time": 1775827630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1727891810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "*今天的月相？"}
{"time": 1775827639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1195179563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=35002447]（谁啊）"}
{"time": 1775827668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1255144220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“小女子收到，下面的事情就由我们解决。”"}
{"time": 1775827711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1755232947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;对吗&#93;,file=AECA53113AD07718AEED93469C0FDDD1.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSSYmaCk394t7DIksmEyRA036VzaxjGpgMg_wooweCu37HjkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQz8SrT3KXwRg50sDEkvb_7noC3KeCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMK9MOtQ7Gb25vjaeOUcA58dSEzfF89Tm4BJsY56ZyscYvwzDyYXCCDeXOEi-PWUL6g,file_size=54086]"}
{"time": 1775827781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "564884051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "一个穿着破烂西风骑士团制服的中年男人"}
{"time": 1775827793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "719552281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“我是赫尔曼，伊利亚的侄子”"}
{"time": 1775827806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458605672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“谁问你了”"}
{"time": 1775827810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1731012657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=D4D178F346D789C2AF80C450B07E0CB5.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQYAdeYhyD-BJ75UM2S20Akf-kE0xi11wUg_woo7b34jbLjkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQyg0k8CJ9adNt1QaJDQK6GXoCEXeCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAISMK9MOtQ7Gb25vjaeOUcA58dSEzfF89Tm4BJsY56ZyscYvwzDyYXCCDeXOEi-PWUL6g,file_size=93109]"}
{"time": 1775827816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1770574099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "那个穿着破烂骑士团制服的男人抬起头。他的脸上带着疲惫和悲伤，但眼神依然锐利。他看起来大约四十岁，棕色短发已经有些花白，下巴上布满胡茬。"}
{"time": 1775827821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56330898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“你们……是骑士团的人？”他的声音沙哑，“还是琴团长派来的冒险家？”"}
{"time": 1775827823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "976745027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“你也被抓进来了？”"}
{"time": 1775827831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "76609505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "\"我们是冒险家\""}
{"time": 1775827845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "660166061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“伊利亚·赫尔曼……我的叔叔。三年前，他还是须弥教令院最杰出的炼金学者之一。他的研究课题是‘元素力的去神化’——说白了，就是让没有神之眼的普通人也能安全地使用元素力。”\n赫尔曼叹了口气。"}
{"time": 1775827851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "307406014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“他的出发点是好的。我婶婶芙蕾雅……我的婶婶，死于一场由神之眼持有者引发的事故。一个喝醉的火系神之眼持有者在须弥城酒馆失控，火焰烧毁了整栋建筑。芙蕾雅婶婶就在里面。”"}
{"time": 1775827864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1719553627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“从那以后，伊利亚叔叔就变了。他的研究从‘让普通人获得元素力’变成了‘让神之眼持有者失去特权’。他被教令院驱逐，然后被愚人众收留……”"}
{"time": 1775827869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1981183715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“你叔叔出发点确实是好的，但他最好别出发”"}
{"time": 1775827869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1233758910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“我不是来抓他的。我是来找他，劝他回头的。我们是彼此最后的亲人了。但他不听。他把我关在这里，说等他成功了，我就会明白。”"}
{"time": 1775827873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1738600127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“他每天都来看我，跟我说话。说他的研究进展，说他有多接近成功。他的眼神……那不是邪恶，那是疯狂。是一种被悲伤和执念吞噬殆尽后的疯狂。”\n“求你们……如果可能的话，不要杀他。制服他，阻止他，但……不要杀他。他曾经是一个温柔的人。”"}
{"time": 1775827904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1163438170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "”杀与不杀，取决于他想不想和我们以命相搏“"}
{"time": 1775827918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "658996305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“小女子可不清楚会不会下狠手。”"}
{"time": 1775827928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "424132217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“但是真动起手来我可不会留手。”"}
{"time": 1775827951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "447095179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我懒得和他讲道理”"}
{"time": 1775827965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2104813953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "”如果他想把在场的各位都杀了，那我们也不可能手下留情。”"}
{"time": 1775827969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1605106290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "赫尔曼从怀里摸出一枚小小的徽章——那是一枚镌刻着风车与锁图案的西风教会徽记，已经磨损得厉害。\n“这是我家传的护符。婶婶生前总是把它带在身上。她说它能‘锁住最珍贵的东西’。”他的眼眶微微泛红，“把它带在身上吧。在最危险的时刻，它或许能保护你们一次。这是我唯一能提供的帮助了。”"}
{"time": 1775827973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1963521477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "\"很难的啦，今天就是月圆之夜\""}
{"time": 1775827977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "405562054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "芙蕾雅的护符：这是一件一次性魔法物品。当佩戴者的生命值降至0或以下时，护符会自动碎裂，为佩戴者恢复2d8+5点生命值。这是一次性效果。"}
