{"time": 1775829249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810434335", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "*开狂暴"}
{"time": 1775829253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1083485147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "车间的正中央是一个直径约二十尺的巨大圆形池子。池中不是水，而是一种浓稠的、不断变换着颜色的液态物质——它时而如火焰般橙红，时而如雷霆般紫白，时而又如冰霜般湛蓝。池面上悬浮着数枚浑浊的元素凝露，它们缓缓旋转，不断从池中吸取能量，又释放出扭曲的灵光。"}
{"time": 1775829256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1278458801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "*AC31"}
{"time": 1775829262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "412573450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "在池边，一个女人正俯身在一张操作台前，专注地记录着什么。她大约四十岁，棕褐色的皮肤表明她来自须弥，头发被一丝不苟地盘在脑后，脸上戴着一副镶有多个镜片的复杂护目镜。她的白大褂上沾满了各种颜色的污渍。"}
{"time": 1775829283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1851493457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=A8B1C47CC5394D44F2B2CAE76C9DADC6.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRABKj5dakLefoACgoTcbXzRZpEhBjmgjQg_wooxN7izLfjkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQE4sODz420WsBRXfubk9DU3oCDVyCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMK9MOtQ7Gb25vjaeOUcA58dSEzfF89Tm4BJsY56ZyscYvwzDyYXCCDeXOEi-PWUL6g,file_size=852326]"}
{"time": 1775829301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "279825651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“你谁阿”"}
{"time": 1775829302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "132520539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "听到你们的脚步声，她直起身，推了推护目镜，用一种审视标本般的目光打量着你们。\n“哦？稀客。”她的声音带着一种过分平静的愉悦，“伊利亚没告诉我今天有客人。不过没关系，我正好需要一些……新鲜的材料。”"}
{"time": 1775829311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515212656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“我是须弥教令院生论派的学者”"}
{"time": 1775829317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1993188241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "“阁下有草元素神之眼吗？”"}
{"time": 1775829325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267222730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "“我是说，给草吗”"}
{"time": 1775829333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "771182861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你看起来有点……臭”*捂着鼻子"}
{"time": 1775829337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814350492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“你们看，提瓦特的元素生命多么美丽——史莱姆、晶蝶、龙蜥……它们天生就能与元素共舞。为什么人类不行？为什么只有那些被神‘选中’的人才能享受这份恩赐？”"}
{"time": 1775829339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506176839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“你是哪位？小女子和你素不相识。”"}
{"time": 1775829345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "505220204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "我先飞起来 飞高高！"}
{"time": 1775829352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1131032009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“我和伊利亚，我们在修正这个错误。他要用炼成阵‘解放’被神之眼垄断的元素力，我则要创造出能够完美适应元素的人类——不，比人类更好的东西。”"}
{"time": 1775829358, "type": "recv", "message_id": "527757497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不飞高高了"}
{"time": 1775829362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "818100009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "她笑了，笑容中没有任何恶意，只有纯粹的、对科学的狂热。\n“你们不会理解的。没关系。很快你们就会成为这伟大进程的一部分——以实验体的身份。”"}
{"time": 1775829368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800705745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "突袭"}
{"time": 1775829371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "931216009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“谁问你了”"}
{"time": 1775829374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "796332655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "能量飞弹突袭"}
{"time": 1775829378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418260717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".init clear"}
{"time": 1775829378, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1418260717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "已清空先攻列表"}
{"time": 1775829380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499664272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "她将一支琥珀色的注射器刺入颈侧，嘴角勾起一抹近乎温柔的笑意。"}
{"time": 1775829388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "156110772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "下一刻，她的脊背猛然弓起。皮肤从棕褐蜕变为泛着暗红光泽的灰黑，一层深红色的几丁质甲壳从皮下翻涌而出，覆盖全身。她的双臂向外撕裂——袖管炸开，十指伸长、扭曲、刺破皮肤，化作四对漆黑的利爪。"}
{"time": 1775829391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984591814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "自肋部到腕骨之间，半透明的翼膜猛地展开，暗红的血管脉络在其中搏动。她的面容同时崩解：耳朵拉长变尖，双眼被浑浊的琥珀色吞没，瞳孔缩成一道竖直的细缝。她张开嘴，犬齿交错如锯齿，脖颈两侧裂开几道随呼吸翕动的细缝。"}
{"time": 1775829402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660774899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "她缓缓升离地面，四爪舒张，翼膜在元素池的光芒中投下扭曲的剪影。"}
{"time": 1775829405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "914155451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“现在，”她的声音沙哑而共鸣，“让我们开始真正的实验吧。”"}
{"time": 1775829412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442976068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=236D7F1F7AC205DDA6D66B860BB74990.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRms644quC2EOiwfj2d1BSLdPCzUBiT7C0g_woo7N2hirjjkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQGaaa9bio9m7SSiD_JknMhXoCGbaCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMK9MOtQ7Gb25vjaeOUcA58dSEzfF89Tm4BJsY56ZyscYvwzDyYXCCDeXOEi-PWUL6g,file_size=751123]"}
