{"time": 1777305110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1148809843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "*变的比boss还大的白翼抡圆了拳头，把面前的来古士打趴在地上，随后身旁环绕的月结晶散发出共鸣的旋律，将敌人震成了齑粉"}
{"time": 1777305127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1219571767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“令人愉悦，隐德来希，我大概这辈子都不会忘了你吧”"}
{"time": 1777305159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1805081152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“活过来了...恩公真棒！”"}
{"time": 1777305165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1734556651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“活过来了...恩公真棒！”"}
{"time": 1777305217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335947314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "879403626"}, "sender": {"id": "879403626", "name": "星间尘"}, "message": "“你这个伊利亚不如另一个世界那个魔法少女伊O雅啊“"}
{"time": 1777305227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1812631447", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "伊利亚跪倒在炼成阵的中心。他周身的元素光芒开始失控地闪烁，皮肤上的能量纹路变得混乱而狂暴。鲜血从他的嘴角、眼角、耳孔渗出。"}
{"time": 1777305231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433591357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "他抬起头，看向你们。那一刻，他眼中的狂热终于褪去，取而代之的是一种深深的、难以言喻的疲惫。"}
{"time": 1777305239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "277203821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“失败了……吗……”\n他咳出一口血。\n“也好……芙蕾雅……我累了……”"}
{"time": 1777305245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "571457983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "就在这时，整个实验室开始剧烈震动。炼成阵的光芒变得刺目而混乱，四根角柱同时发出刺耳的共鸣声。穹顶上开始有碎石掉落。"}
{"time": 1777305247, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1634939266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "时间跳跃"}
{"time": 1777305249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063753313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“炼成阵……”伊利亚艰难地开口，“失去了控制……它会……它会引爆连接的地脉……蒙德城……”\n他拼尽最后的力气，指向高台下方的一个金属面板。"}
{"time": 1777305252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1308252049", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呵呵，说话也得有个头吧”"}
{"time": 1777305261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "307075410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“控制台……密码是芙蕾雅的生日"}
{"time": 1777305277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678619146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1073830032", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“芙蕾雅的生日是几号”"}
